OL,3,GNEWSAShop fire started accidentally,
OL,4,Ainvestigation finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which severely damaged a shop in
OL,7,FDerby was started accidentally, an
OL,8,Finvestigation has found.
OL,10,FCrews from Derbyshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService were called to Cardigan Street
OL,12,Fin Chaddesden at about 09:15 BST on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FFirefighters from Alfreton, Ascot
OL,16,FDrive, Kingsway, and Nottingham Road
OL,17,Fstations arrived to find a
OL,18,Fwell-developed fire in the roof space,
OL,19,Fa spokesperson said.
